  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「つい昨日のことのように思ってたけど、もう二年も経ってたのね～……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 71,
    "dress": "old-closeeye-swim",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-closeeye-swim_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「あのとき、二年前の『夏祭り』で……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「わたしは、というか和菓子屋の御影はふつうに人形焼きの屋台をだしただけ……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 71,
    "dress": "old-closeeye-swim",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-closeeye-swim_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「その人形焼きが他の屋台の料理やお菓子より何倍も、何十倍も美味だっただけ……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 71,
    "dress": "old-closeeye-swim",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-closeeye-swim_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「おかげでうちの屋台にお客さんが殺到しちゃって、他の屋台が大赤字でね～……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「おまけに、うちの屋台の周囲に異様な人混みができて……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 71,
    "dress": "old-closeeye-swim",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-closeeye-swim_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「お客さんが転んだり揉めごとをおこしたりして、パニックになっちゃったの～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 71,
    "dress": "old-closeeye-swim",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-closeeye-swim_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「それだけのことよ～。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「いろいろ尾ひれがついたのか、『人形焼き事件』なんて呼ばれて騒がれてるみたいだけどね～……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「二年前はね～、円城寺さんちがパニックを鎮圧するために……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「軍隊みたいなの出動させちゃって、余計に大騒ぎになっちゃってね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 71,
    "dress": "old-closeeye-swim",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-closeeye-swim_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「けっきょく、『夏祭り』は中止になって……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 71,
    "dress": "old-closeeye-swim",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-closeeye-swim_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「その責任をとるために、和菓子屋の御影の本店は休業してるの～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 71,
    "dress": "old-closeeye-swim",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-closeeye-swim_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「過剰に警戒されちゃってね、『今年も何かやらかすつもりだろう！』って……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「繁華街のひとたちに、追いかけ回されちゃってね～……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 71,
    "dress": "old-closeeye-swim",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-closeeye-swim_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「大迷惑だわ～。とはいえ、わたしは美味しいものが食べられたらそれでいい……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 71,
    "dress": "old-closeeye-swim",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-closeeye-swim_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「だから今年は他の屋台で振る舞われる料理やお菓子を、こうして試食して……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 71,
    "dress": "old-closeeye-swim",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-closeeye-swim_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「味見してね、もっと美味しくなるようにアドバイスすることにしたの～……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 71,
    "dress": "old-closeeye-swim",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-closeeye-swim_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「二年前の騒ぎの原因は、和菓子屋の御影が飛び抜けて美味しいものを提供してしまったことだからね～……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「他のお店も同じぐらい美味しいものを振る舞えば、まぁ騒ぎにはならないでしょ～……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「わたしは、今年は出店しないつもりだしね～。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 71,
    "dress": "old-closeeye-swim",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-closeeye-swim_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「たぶん、円城寺さんちのれいかちゃんに怒られちゃうし～……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「美味しいものを食べられたら、それでいいのよ～……もぐもぐっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 71,
    "dress": "old-closeeye-swim",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-closeeye-swim_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「ぺっ、やり直し！　これは何なのよ～、生ゴミ？　料理をなめてるの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 71,
    "dress": "old-closeeye-swim",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-closeeye-swim_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「視覚を封じることで、せめて口には入れられるようにしたのに～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「駄目な料理やお菓子は、見ただけで身体が受けつけなくなるからね～……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かすみ",
    "text": "「わたし燃費がよすぎてね～、食べたぶんだけ発熱するから……？」"
